WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Prepare the accepted product reference and alpha cutout.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Enter the three-image catalogue brief.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Choose Commercial, three shots, and Codex GPT-5.6-Sol.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Review the three-shot screenplay and correct the motion duration.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Assign the accepted Olive Travel Cup to every shot.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Choose square format, Photo / Commercial, and FAL Flux2Max Edit.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Inspect the three completed catalogue stills.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Render only the motion hero with FAL Seedance.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Inspect the FAL upscale asset and its recorded 4096-pixel dimensions.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Review factual listing copy with unknown merchant specifications marked.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
Download the board package and hand off the organized production set.
